From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] SystemUI power menu: labels in black at 14 sp, on one line

The power menu's labels were grey 117 at 12 sp (textAppearanceSmall's
secondary colour), and "重启回 Kindle 系统" broke inside a word, "系" at the end
of one line and "统" alone on the next (Test V45): the panel is 120 dp wide,
96 dp inside its padding, and the label needs about 101 dp at 12 sp.
docs/design/eink-ui.md: text black on white (rule 1); 14 sp at least for
anything but times and page numbers (rule 8), as the home screen's labels.

The labels are now the primary text colour at 14 sp, and the panel is 180 dp
wide: the longest label needs 118 dp at 14 sp, 153 dp at the largest font
scale (1.3), plus 24 dp of padding. The panel stays at the right edge; only
its width and the labels change.

--- a/packages/SystemUI/res/layout/global_actions_item.xml
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/res/layout/global_actions_item.xml
@@ -42,8 +42,9 @@
         android:layout_gravity="top|center_horizontal"
         android:paddingTop="10dp"
         android:gravity="center"
-        android:textSize="12sp"
+        android:textSize="14sp"
         android:textAppearance="?android:attr/textAppearanceSmall"
+        android:textColor="?android:attr/textColorPrimary"
         />
 
     <TextView
--- a/packages/SystemUI/res/values/dimens.xml
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/res/values/dimens.xml
@@ -831,7 +831,7 @@
 
     <dimen name="hwui_edge_margin">16dp</dimen>
 
-    <dimen name="global_actions_panel_width">120dp</dimen>
+    <dimen name="global_actions_panel_width">180dp</dimen>
 
     <dimen name="global_actions_top_padding">120dp</dimen>
 
